    "text": "<p>Uracil is base present in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>RNA</mi></math>&nbsp; with the following structure. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>%</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> in uracil is _______.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/b8ecff46-8ca7-43ef-8228-0aba27b61cf6-9884718.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 269px;\" /></p>",
