  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/b8ecff46-8ca7-43ef-8228-0aba27b61cf6-9884718.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 403px;\" /></p><p>The molecular formula of uracil is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>The molar mass of uracil&nbsp; = 112 g/mol</p><p>Mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>%</mo></math>&nbsp;of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>28</mn><mn>112</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></math>&nbsp;= 25 %</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
